━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ PatternArms is Tuple

` The arms of a stream pattern being typed (`arms-type`): whether an arm selects what it
` materializes, whether they are scoped, whether an action's type cannot be inferred, whether
` they join as alternatives, and the arm being typed (`enter-arm`).

+ selects Bool
+ scoped Bool
+ uninferred Bool
+ joined Bool
+ arm SyntaxId = 0

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ RuleArms is Tuple

` The arms of a stream pattern and what they are converted to (`type-stream-arms`): the type
` given them, whether they give a span of the source, whether they are a rule's, whether they
